# UCAD example API test http request

### Note: Install VSCode REST Client extension to use this file

### GET server root
GET http://localhost:3000/


## /media resource

### GET /media
GET http://localhost:3000/api/media

### GET media item by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/media/6

### Add new media item including media file
POST http://localhost:3000/api/media
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

New cat image
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="user_id"

2
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="image.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-cat.png
------Boundary--

### Update existing media item
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/media/4
content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "New title",
  "description": "Updated desc"
}

### Delete existing media item
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/media/5



######################



## /users resource

### GET /users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### GET user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/3

### Add new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "testimies",
  "password": "miesmies",
  "email": "olen.mies@mailmail.com"
}

### Update existing user
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/2
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "testinainen",
  "password": "nainennainen",
  "email": "olen.nainen@mailmail.com"
}

### Delete existing user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/5


######################


### GET /likes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/likes

### GET user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/likes/2

### Add new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/likes
content-type: application/json

{
  "media_id": 1,
  "user_id": 4
}

### Delete existing user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/likes/3
